{"id": "02b", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[warmly] And there's Gary. Gary is a goldfish. [pause] Gary has seen things."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[warm, rushing] Bye, loves! Long shift! [pause] Remember, mistakes are how we learn!"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[mumbling] Mistakes are how we get laughed at."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And then there's Ivy. Your best friend since kindergarten. She builds inventions. [pause] They explode. [pause] A lot."}, {"speaker": "IVY", "text": "[delighted, coughing] Fail number three hundred and twelve! Rocket sneakers! [pause] Lesson learned: never wear rocket sneakers... indoors."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[amazed] How are you HAPPY about this?"}, {"speaker": "IVY", "text": "[cheerful] Because now I know one more way it doesn't work! [pause] Anyway! Big news!"}, {"speaker": "IVY", "text": "[excited] I signed us up for the talent show! Friday! In front of the WHOLE school!"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[horrified] The WHOLE school?! Ivy! What if I mess up?!"}, {"speaker": "IVY", "text": "[shrugs, happy] Then you mess up! That's the fun part!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] For you... it was not the fun part."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 5.8, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 76, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "start_time_seconds": 5.8, "end_time_seconds": 10.56, "character_start_index": 76, "character_end_index": 160, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_seconds": 10.56, "end_time_seconds": 13.120000000000001, "character_start_index": 160, "character_end_index": 206, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 13.120000000000001, "end_time_seconds": 21.84, "character_start_index": 206, "character_end_index": 324, "dialogue_input_index": 3}, {"voice_id":